{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は東京個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず！\n今日のお洋服はこのような感じでした〜ヽ(・∀・)ノどうですかね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は来てくださってありがとうございます！(^-^)しかし...風が強くて大雨でしたね\n台風みたいな天候でみなさんとても寒かったと思います...o(T□T)o"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみなさんは温かかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日よく言われたことがあります。\nそれは最初の方から比べると成長したね！\n顔つきがかわったねなど自分じゃ絶対に気づかないところをみなさんは見ていて下さっていて、すこし照れちゃったのです♪(/ω＼*)\n東京ということで、予想以上の乃木坂ファミリーの方々が集まりました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直めっちゃビックリしましたw(°O°)w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ握手会の仕組みを細かいとこまでわからないのでね〜(´・д・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも沢山学びましたよん!!\nなかなか名前覚えられなくてごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/03/31/0511239/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も聞くかもしれませんが、そこはご協力お願いします!!(＞＜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もみなさんから沢山の事を学びました！\nこれを生かして前に進んでいきますね!!ヽ(・∀・)ノ\n本当にありがとうございました(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかったみなさんも次の機会に会いましょうね!!\nではっ!!\nへばなっ!!"}],"source":"archive"}